<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Secure Messenger | Sovereign Ghost Protocol</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-black: #000000;
            --ghost-dark-green: #004D00;
            --ghost-neon-green: #27AE60;
            --ghost-white: #FFFFFF;
            --ghost-cream: #FFFDD0;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-black);
            color: var(--ghost-white);
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
        }

        header {
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #004D00, #000000);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);
        }

        /* SIMPLE WORKING SLOT MACHINE - HORIZONTAL */
        .slot-machine {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            border: 2px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.3);
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .reel {
            display: block;
            width: 55px;
            height: 80px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .reel-inner {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            transition: transform 0ms linear;
        }

        .reel-char {
            display: block;
            height: 80px;
            line-height: 80px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--ghost-neon-green);
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
        }

        .spacer {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 20px;
        }

        .tagline {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        section {
            background: rgba(0, 77, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.3);
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #004D00;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        ul {
            margin-left: 20px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        li {
            margin: 8px 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .ghost-line {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            color: var(--ghost-cream);
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            color: #777;
            border-top: 1px solid #004D00;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .reel { width: 35px; height: 50px; }
            .reel-char { height: 50px; line-height: 50px; font-size: 28px; }
            .spacer { width: 12px; }
            .slot-machine { gap: 2px; padding: 10px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div id="slot-machine" class="slot-machine"></div>
    <p class="tagline">Sovereign Build v10.8.3 | The Architecture of Privacy</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
    <div class="ghost-line">"To you, I am a conduit. To the world, you are a Ghost."</div>

    <section>
        <h2>1. Identity Sovereignty (The 12-Word Master Key)</h2>
        <p><strong>The Advantage:</strong> Unlike Signal or WhatsApp, SecureMessenger requires zero personal data.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><span class="highlight">Zero Identifiers:</span> No phone numbers, no SIM cards, and no email addresses.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Local Generation:</span> Your identity is a private 12-word cryptographic seed generated entirely on your device.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Total Ownership:</span> I do not store passwords. If you hold your 12 words, you hold your data.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>2. The Blind Relay: Passing Through the Shadows</h2>
        <p><strong>The Advantage:</strong> Traditional servers log IP addresses and timestamps. My "Blind Relay" doctrine makes the server a mere conduit.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><span class="highlight">IP Volatility:</span> Your IP address is processed in volatile RAM and instantly overwritten.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">RAM-to-RAM Relay:</span> Messages exist on the server only until they reach the recipient.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Full-Spectrum Media Encryption:</span> All data is encrypted locally before upload.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>3. Forensic Shredding: User-Commanded Destruction</h2>
        <p><strong>The Advantage:</strong> Standard "deletion" leaves traces. SecureMessenger gives you a digital shredder.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><span class="highlight">Absolute Sovereignty:</span> You are the sole authority over your data.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Overwriting Protocol:</span> Data is overwritten with high-entropy noise before removal.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Hardware Armor:</span> Keys are isolated in your phone's Secure Element.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>4. The Sovereign Handshake: Invisible by Default</h2>
        <p><strong>The Advantage:</strong> Stop discovery probing. You are invisible until you choose to be seen.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><span class="highlight">24-Hour Invites:</span> One-time temporary 6-digit codes.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Ghost Mode:</span> Freezes your status as "Offline" at the server level.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Quarantine Shield:</span> Blocked users don't know they've been quarantined.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>5. Physical Sovereignty: Your Alibi in a Crisis</h2>
        <p><strong>The Advantage:</strong> Security holds even if your device is seized.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><span class="highlight">The Panic PIN:</span> Triggers immediate "Nuclear Wipe" of all keys.</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">The 503 Alibi:</span> After wipe, displays "Network Error (503)".</li>
            <li><span class="highlight">Screen Armor:</span> Blocks screenshots and screen-recording.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>Created, financed and designed by dQuantumBear</p>
    <p>Contact: securemessenger0@gmail.com</p>
    <p>© 2026 Secure Messenger Project. Engineered for Privacy.</p>
</footer>

<script>
    class SlotMachine {
        constructor(text) {
            this.text = text.toUpperCase();
            this.reels = [];
            this.container = document.getElementById('slot-machine');
        }

        init() {
            this.container.innerHTML = '';
            
            for (let i = 0; i < this.text.length; i++) {
                const char = this.text[i];
                
                if (char === ' ') {
                    const spacer = document.createElement('span');
                    spacer.className = 'spacer';
                    this.container.appendChild(spacer);
                    continue;
                }
                
                const reel = document.createElement('div');
                reel.className = 'reel';
                
                const inner = document.createElement('div');
                inner.className = 'reel-inner';
                
                const chars = "0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!@#$%^&*()_+";
                const length = 70 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 40);
                
                for (let j = 0; j < length - 1; j++) {
                    const span = document.createElement('span');
                    span.className = 'reel-char';
                    span.textContent = chars[Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length)];
                    inner.appendChild(span);
                }
                
                const target = document.createElement('span');
                target.className = 'reel-char';
                target.textContent = char;
                inner.appendChild(target);
                
                reel.appendChild(inner);
                this.container.appendChild(reel);
                
                this.reels.push({
                    element: inner,
                    length: length
                });
            }
            
            setTimeout(() => this.animate(), 50);
        }
        
        animate() {
            let charHeight = 80;
            if (this.reels[0] && this.reels[0].element.children[0]) {
                charHeight = this.reels[0].element.children[0].offsetHeight;
            }
            
            this.reels.forEach((reel, i) => {
                const distance = (reel.length - 1) * charHeight;
                const duration = 2500 + (Math.random() * 2500);
                const delay = i * 60;
                
                reel.element.style.transition = `transform ${duration}ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.4, 1) ${delay}ms`;
                reel.element.style.transform = `translateY(-${distance}px)`;
            });
        }
    }
    
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
        const machine = new SlotMachine("SECURE MESSENGER");
        machine.init();
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>
